# scripts/opcount: `tailbench bench chain N` makes N calls of a chain of
# four fallible functions, each returning the next one's call (INLINE-RETURN),
# its failures caught in the loop. The control is the same functions in hand
# Go, each returning (int, error), and a type switch on the error.
unit call
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench chain {n}
control benchmarks/tailcall/testdata/control
